      "worked_solution": "Using the identity $1+{cot}^{2}⁡w={csc}^{2}⁡w,$ we rewrite and simplify the expression as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sin}^{2}⁡w\\,(1+{cot}^{2}⁡w) & ={sin}^{2}⁡w\\cdot {csc}^{2}⁡w \\\\  & ={sin}^{2}⁡w\\cdot {(\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡w})}^{2} \\\\  & ={sin}^{2}⁡w\\cdot \\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡w} \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$",
