      "math_academy_id": "q-65446",
      "knowledge_point_id": "85555bce-debf-5165-ba6a-3c232deeeb0a",
      "knowledge_point": "Simplifying an Expression by Factoring the Alternate Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity",
      "problem": "Simplify $\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }-\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta .$",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the following identity: \n\n$$\n1={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, and then factoring it as a difference of squares, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }-\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }-\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta )\\,(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta )}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }-\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta )}\\,(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta )}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }}-\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta }+\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta -\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
