      "problem": "Simplify $\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta .$",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the following identity: \n\n$$\n1={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, and then factoring it as a difference of squares, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta )\\,\\cancel{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta )}}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }}-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta )-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
